// `kl::sort`'s quicksort, ported from pdqsort (https://github.com/orlp/pdqsort, b1ef26a):
// pdqsort.h's insertion sorts, sort3, partition_right, partition_left and pdqsort_loop. This is an
// altered version: it swaps in place of moves, keeps the pivot in its slot rather than in a local,
// leaves out the branchless block partition, and its heap sort fallback is kl's own. The notice
// from pdqsort.h follows.
